  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 9002.11 Certification of breath test operator",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9002.11 “Certification of breath test operator” means a 12-month period in which a law enforcement officer, who meets the requirements of Saf-C 9004.02, is authorized to conduct an analysis of a person’s breath for the purposes of determining its alcohol concentration.\n\nSource. #12556, eff 6-21-18",
